        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of a plain desktop?<br>Bring your screen to life with <strong>My Neko Pet</strong>, your adorable and playful digital cat companion!<br>My Neko Pet is a living, breathing digital pet that plays right on your screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How to Play</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your mouse to guide Neko’s gaze.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drag Neko with the left mouse button to move it around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While dragging, use the mouse wheel to resize Neko.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on Neko to interact and see its reactions.</p></li></ul>",
